<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Scottish</p>
<p>premier division after Saturday's final round of matches:</p>
<p>25 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>16 - Brian Laudrup (Rangers)</p>
<p>15 - Paul Wright (Kilmarnock)</p>
<p>14 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), John Robertson (Hearts)</p>
<p>13 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers), Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
<p>12 - Kjetil Olafsson (Dundee United), Paolo Di Canio (Celtic)</p>
<p>11 - Darren Jackson (Hibernian)</p>
